WEBVTT

00:20:27.563 --> 00:20:30.124
because I feel that it's
just not doing good for me."

00:20:30.148 --> 00:20:32.486
AG: It took some convincing,
but they agreed.

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:35.088
NN: When I dropped out,
then I had a lot of free time.

00:20:35.112 --> 00:20:39.816
So that's when I realized
that I also liked to learn by myself.

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:43.156
AG: Nico eagerly dove into
online programming tutorials.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:46.196
NN: Now I got all of the fundamentals
for how a computer works,

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:48.150
how do you run a program,

00:20:48.174 --> 00:20:51.346
how do you efficiently
manage software resources ...

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:53.645
AG: After two years
of teaching himself to code,

00:20:53.669 --> 00:20:55.346
Nico went on the job hunt.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:58.186
His psychologist encouraged him
to apply to SAP.

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.449
NN: I was selected
to be in the first wave